{{Short description|Ranking system for men's national association football teams}}

The '''AFA Men's World Ranking''' is a ranking system for men's national association football teams, published by the [[Adonian Football Association]] (AFA), a body of the [[Adonian Community]]. The rankings were introduced in 1992 and are updated periodically based on the results of international matches. The rankings are used by AFA to seed teams in the [[AFA World Cup]] qualification draw and final tournament draw.

